  "notes": [
    "Policy: nothing needs a daily refresh yet. Sources that print daily (Kalshi, TE spots, AISI) refresh weekly. True monthlies (BLS/Census/USASpending/FRED M3) stay monthly.",
    "Stagger due windows so packs do not all fire the same day (API load + easier failure triage).",
    "TEMP: AISI + TE scrapes on VPS weekends until Mac Mini \u2014 then move those hosts to [macmini] and weekdays to [Mon]/[Tue].",
